<title>USA: Daisytek International says Mark Layton CEO.</title>
<headline>Daisytek International says Mark Layton CEO.</headline>
<dateline>PLANO, Texas 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daisytek International Corp said Tuesday it named Mark Layton chief executive.</p>
<p>The company said Layton will continue to hold the jobs of president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>The company said Layton replaces David Heap, who is currently chairman of the board.</p>
